{"sections":[{"slug":"Zar-fl-et","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Zar-fl-et"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">平展景与平坦景的比较</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Zariski 景, 平展景与平坦景的比较"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个概形上可以建立若干种各有特性的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">之间有粗细的关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而其上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何态射</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">同一个对象在不同景中的化身</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即通过这些几何态射的拉回</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间有比较函子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在特殊情况下</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">比较函子为同构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">本页面举例说明一些特殊情况</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">比较函子的建立</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span>\n$$\r\n    f\\colon \\mathsf{Sh}(X_{\\mathrm{fl}})\\to \\mathsf{Sh}(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}})\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski意象","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的比较映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">右伴随</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">前推</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">部分</span> $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">来自范畴的嵌入</span> $X_{\\mathrm{Zar}}\\to X_{\\mathrm{fl}}$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">左伴随</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>) $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">可由层化定义</span>:<span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $F\\in\\mathsf{Sh}(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}})$, $f^*F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X_{\\mathrm{fl}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的预层</span> $U\\mapsto \\operatorname{colim}_{U\\to V\\to X}F(V)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的层化</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>$\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">的比较</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" III.4.9, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hilbert定理90","text":"Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 90"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">典范的映射</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}},\\mathbb G_m) \\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathbb G_m) \\to H^1(X_{\\mathrm{fl}},\\mathbb G_m)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">均为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">变为</span> $\\mathbb G_m$. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Leray谱序列","text":"Leray <span lang=\"zh\">谱序列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n    H^p(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}},R^qf_*\\mathbb G_m)\\Rightarrow H^{p+q}(X_{\\mathrm{fl}},\\mathbb G_m)\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">来自</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/滤过谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤过谱</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Gamma_{X_{\\mathrm{Zar}}}(\\tau_{\\leq\\bullet}f_*\\mathbb G_m)$), <span lang=\"zh\">只需证明</span>\n$$\r\n    R^1f_*\\mathbb G_m = 0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $R^1f_*\\mathbb G_m$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景上的预层</span> $U\\mapsto H^1(U_{\\mathrm{fl}},\\mathbb G_m)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的层化</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">所以只需证明如下命题</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">我们甚至可以对一般的</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>):</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" III.4.10). <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部环</span>, $U=\\operatorname{Spec}A$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(U_{\\mathrm{fl}},\\mathrm{GL}_n) = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></em>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">对任意上同调类</span> $\\alpha\\in H^1(U_{\\mathrm{fl}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在忠实平坦有限型仿射</span> $U$-<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span> $V=\\operatorname{Spec}B$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及上圈</span> $\\phi\\colon V\\times_U V \\to \\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">表现</span> $\\alpha$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $\\phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">又可视为同构</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    B^n\\otimes_A B &amp;\\simeq B^n \\otimes_B (B\\otimes_A B) \\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\r\n    (B\\otimes_A B)^n\r\n     \\overset{\\phi}{\\to} (B\\otimes_A B)^n\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq (B\\otimes_A B)\\otimes_B B^n \\simeq B\\otimes_A B^n,\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这恰好给出了</span> $B^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">下降为</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的下降数据</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">回忆模的忠实平坦下降</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/MilneEC","text":"Milne"}},{"Plain":" I.2.21). <span lang=\"zh\">由下降理论</span>, $B^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">来自于平坦有限生成</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这样的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模一定是自由</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">于是上圈</span> $\\phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">上同调等价于平凡的上圈</span>.\n$\\square$</p>\n<h3>$\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的比较</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski景","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/平坦景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上计算同一个群概形</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ (<span lang=\"zh\">对应的层</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">比较映射</span>\n$$\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\\to\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\\to\r\nH^1(X_{\\mathrm{flat}},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">均为同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于域</span> $k$, $H^1(\\operatorname{Spec}k,\\mathbb G_m)=0$. <span lang=\"zh\">这是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hilbert定理90","text":"Hilbert <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span> 90"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明概要</span></em>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $L_n(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}})$, $L_n(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}})$, $L_n(X_{\\mathrm{fl}})$ <span lang=\"zh\">分别为</span> Zariski, <span lang=\"zh\">平展和平坦景上局部自由</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的等价类</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">可以证明局部平凡化对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/非交换Čech上同调","text":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">上圈</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">给出了双射</span>\n$$\r\n     L_n(X_{*}) \\to H^1(X_{*},\\mathrm{GL}_n)\\,(*=\\mathrm{Zar},\\mathrm{\\'et},\\mathrm{fl}).\r\n $$</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">然后证明拉回函子</span> $M\\mapsto M^{\\mathrm{fl}}$, $M\\mapsto M^{\\mathrm{\\'et}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了双射</span> $L_n(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}}) \\to L_n(X_{\\mathrm{fl}})$, $L_n(X_{\\mathrm{Zar}}) \\to L_n(X_{\\mathrm{\\'et}})$. (<span lang=\"zh\">拉回函子的具体构造见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平展景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平展景</span>"}},{"Plain":".) <span lang=\"zh\">需要证明三件事情</span>:</p>\n<p>(a) <span lang=\"zh\">平坦</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">平展</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">局部自由</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模均形如</span> $M^{\\mathrm{fl}}$, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n<p>(b) <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M^{\\mathrm{fl}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">平坦局部自由</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部自由</span>.</p>\n<p>(c) <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M,N$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景上的局部自由</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M\\simeq N$ <span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当</span> $M^{\\mathrm{fl}} \\simeq N^{\\mathrm{fl}}$.</p>\n<p>(a) <span lang=\"zh\">的证明本质上是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层的忠实平坦下降","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层的忠实平坦下降</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>(b) <span lang=\"zh\">的证明用到如下观察</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">投射模可由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/忠实平坦环同态","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">忠实平坦环同态</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">探测</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">忠实平坦</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $B\\otimes_A M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为投射</span> $B$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为投射</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span> $B\\otimes_A \\operatorname{Hom}_A(M,-) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_B(B\\otimes_A M, B\\otimes_A -)$.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n"}]}}}]}